*> vybe-test: cobol/conditions/test_condition_figuratives
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_conditions.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NAME PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-VAL PIC 9(3) VALUE ZEROS.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF WS-NAME = SPACES
        DISPLAY "NAME-SPACES"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "NAME-SPACES" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "NAME-SPACES"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [NAME-SPACES] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    IF WS-VAL = ZEROS
        DISPLAY "VAL-ZEROS"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "VAL-ZEROS" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "VAL-ZEROS"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [VAL-ZEROS] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

